### Handling Permission Drift

Run `pulumi up` to reapply the configured permission to all objects (existing and new):

```bash
pulumi up
```

The plan will typically show:

```diff
~ resource "scaleway_rdb_privilege" "app" {
    ~ permission = "custom" -> "readwrite"
}
```

